---
interface Props { id?: string; }
const { id = 'tavolo-takeaway' } = Astro.props;
---

<section id={id} class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-crema py-24 md:py-32" data-st-section>

  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-6">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <span class="font-poppins text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-ambra" data-reveal>Due modi di vivere Bottega N.8</span>
      <h2 class="mt-4 font-anton text-[clamp(2.2rem,6vw,4.5rem)] uppercase text-antracite" data-reveal data-delay="0.1">Tavolo o take away</h2>
      <p class="mt-6 font-poppins text-[clamp(1rem,2.5vw,1.2rem)] leading-relaxed text-antracite/70" data-reveal data-delay="0.2">
        Un menù da vivere al tavolo o da portare con te. Che sia una pausa veloce o una cena da condividere, Bottega N.8 ti accoglie al tavolo o ti accompagna a casa.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 font-poppins text-[clamp(0.95rem,2vw,1.1rem)] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-ambra" data-reveal data-delay="0.3">La stessa cura, in ogni piatto.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-10">
      <!-- Tavolo -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-3xl border border-antracite/10 bg-bianco p-8 md:p-10" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <span class="inline-flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ambra/15 text-ambra" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <!-- Tavolo (geometria OTTO: cerchio + forchetta/cucchiaio) -->
              <circle cx="24" cy="14" r="7" />
              <path d="M24 21v20" />
              <path d="M24 33c-5 0-8-3-8-8" opacity="0.7" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3 class="mt-6 font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-antracite">Prenota un tavolo</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 font-poppins text-base leading-relaxed text-antracite/70">
            Siediti, rilassati, lascia che la cucina arrivi a te. L'atmosfera, il servizio, la condivisione.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a href="tel:035297334" class="tap-press touch-target inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-antracite px-6 py-4 font-poppins text-base font-medium text-crema transition-colors hover:bg-nero">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg>
          Chiama: 035 297 334
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Take away -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-3xl bg-antracite p-8 md:p-10" data-reveal data-delay="0.15">
        <div>
          <span class="inline-flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ambra/15 text-ambra" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <!-- Take away (borsa, linea ambra) -->
              <path d="M12 16h24l-2 24H14z" />
              <path d="M18 16v-3a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v3" opacity="0.7" />
              <path d="M16 24h16" opacity="0.5" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3 class="mt-6 font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-crema">Ordina take away</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 font-poppins text-base leading-relaxed text-crema/70">
            La stessa qualità, dove vuoi tu. Ritrova i sapori Bottega N.8 a casa tua.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3">
          <a href="https://deliveroo.it" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="touch-target inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-ambra px-6 py-4 font-poppins text-base font-medium text-nero transition-colors hover:bg-ambra/90">Ordina su Deliveroo</a>
          <a href="https://glovoapp.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="touch-target inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-crema/25 px-6 py-4 font-poppins text-base font-medium text-crema transition-colors hover:bg-crema/10">Ordina su Glovo</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
